On Thu, 22 Feb 2007, carlhnelson@gmail.com wrote:

> Perhaps polymorphing a weapon type that groups, will yield another
> weapon type that groups (e.g. 5 elven arrows will turn into 5 foofie
> foos)?

If they polymorph into foofie foos and foofie foos are stackable, then
they may turn into 5 foofie foos. But in contrast to magicalness, there is
no special code for making sure that stackability is invariant under
polymorphing.

